# Frontend Development Patterns

## Template Structure and Organization

### Base Template System
- **Main Layout**: [data_hall/templates/data_hall/base.html](mdc:data_hall/templates/data_hall/base.html) - 24KB master template
- **Iframe Layout**: [data_hall/templates/data_hall/base_iframe.html](mdc:data_hall/templates/data_hall/base_iframe.html) - For embedded content
- **Shell Template**: [data_hall/templates/data_hall/shell.html](mdc:data_hall/templates/data_hall/shell.html) - Minimal layout

### Key Page Templates
```html
<!-- Main application pages -->
index.html          <!-- Homepage dashboard (27KB, 540 lines) -->
enterprise.html     <!-- Company detail page (16KB, 453 lines) -->
map.html           <!-- Geographic visualization -->
ranking.html       <!-- Company rankings display -->
industry.html      <!-- Industry analysis -->
