## Template Development Patterns

### Template Inheritance
```html
<!-- Base template structure -->
{% extends "data_hall/base.html" %}
{% load static %}

{% block title %}Page Title{% endblock %}

{% block extra_css %}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{% static 'data_hall/css/custom.css' %}">
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
    <!-- Page-specific content -->
{% endblock %}

{% block extra_js %}
    <script src="{% static 'data_hall/js/custom.js' %}"></script>
{% endblock %}
```

### Component-Based Architecture
```html
<!-- Use template components for reusable elements -->
{% include "data_hall/components/company_card.html" with company=company %}
{% include "data_hall/components/ranking_chart.html" with rankings=rankings %}
```

### Data Visualization Patterns
```html
<!-- Chart.js integration -->
<canvas id="rankingChart"></canvas>
<script>
const ctx = document.getElementById('rankingChart');
const chart = new Chart(ctx, {
    type: 'bar',
    data: {
        labels: {{ companies|safe }},
        datasets: [{
            data: {{ scores|safe }},
            backgroundColor: 'rgba(54, 162, 235, 0.2)'
        }]
    }
});
</script>
```

### Map Integration
```html
<!-- Geographic data visualization -->
<div id="map-container" style="height: 600px;"></div>
<script>
// Initialize map with company locations
const map = new Map({
    center: [{{ default_lat }}, {{ default_lng }}],
    zoom: 8
});

// Add company markers
{% for company in companies %}
    map.addMarker({
        lat: {{ company.latitude }},
        lng: {{ company.longitude }},
        popup: "{{ company.company_name }}"
    });
{% endfor %}
</script>
```

