## JavaScript Development Patterns

### AJAX Form Handling
```javascript
// Form submission with CSRF token
function submitForm(formData) {
    fetch('/api/companies/', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: {
            'Content-Type': 'application/json',
            'X-CSRFToken': document.querySelector('[name=csrfmiddlewaretoken]').value
        },
        body: JSON.stringify(formData)
    })
    .then(response => response.json())
    .then(data => {
        if (data.status === 'success') {
            showNotification('Success', 'success');
            refreshTable();
        }
    });
}
```

### Data Table Integration
```javascript
// DataTables configuration for company listings
$('#companyTable').DataTable({
    ajax: '/api/companies/',
    columns: [
        { data: 'company_name', title: '公司名称' },
        { data: 'industry', title: '行业' },
        { data: 'city', title: '城市' },
        { 
            data: 'ranking.comprehensive_score', 
            title: '综合得分',
            render: function(data) {
                return data ? data.toFixed(2) : 'N/A';
            }
        }
    ],
    language: {
        url: '//cdn.datatables.net/plug-ins/1.10.25/i18n/Chinese.json'
    }
});
```

### Chart.js Integration
```javascript
// Multi-dimensional ranking visualization
function createRankingChart(companyData) {
    return new Chart(ctx, {
        type: 'radar',
        data: {
            labels: ['发展潜力', '扩张速度', '创新能力', '资本关注', '团队背景'],
            datasets: [{
                label: companyData.company_name,
                data: [
                    companyData.dev_potential,
                    companyData.expansion_speed,
                    companyData.innovation,
                    companyData.capital_attention,
                    companyData.team_background
                ],
                backgroundColor: 'rgba(54, 162, 235, 0.2)',
                borderColor: 'rgb(54, 162, 235)'
            }]
        }
    });
}
```

## Performance Optimization

### Static File Optimization
```html
<!-- Lazy loading for images -->
<img src="{% static 'data_hall/img/placeholder.jpg' %}" 
     data-src="{{ company.logo_url }}" 
     class="lazy-load"
     alt="{{ company.company_name }}">

<!-- CSS/JS minification and compression -->
{% if not debug %}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{% static 'data_hall/css/app.min.css' %}">
{% else %}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{% static 'data_hall/css/app.css' %}">
{% endif %}
```

### Caching Strategies
```html
<!-- Template fragment caching -->
{% load cache %}
{% cache 300 company_rankings company.keyno %}
    {% include "data_hall/components/ranking_display.html" %}
{% endcache %}
```

### Progressive Web App Features
```html
<!-- Service worker registration -->
<script>
if ('serviceWorker' in navigator) {
    navigator.serviceWorker.register('/static/data_hall/js/sw.js');
}
</script>

<!-- Offline capability -->
